{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1220423001:0":{"text":"어서 솔직하게 말해요! 웬디 양을 어디로 데려간 거죠?","source_cn":"快说实话！你们把温蒂小姐带到哪里去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2B7A8C37E9823B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220423002:0":{"text":"흥! 우리 빅보스가 알게 되면 스탠턴과 여동생 그리고 너희까지 모두 죽은 목숨이야!","source_cn":"呸！要是我们大老板知道了，他和他妹妹，还有你们这些人，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE43FDFE5B89AB592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220423003:0":{"text":"우리 빅보스는 러스트 항에서 알아주는 아주 대단한 인물이라고!","source_cn":"我们大老板可是锈锚港手眼通天的人物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92409BC4BE750DA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220423004:0":{"text":"내가 물어보지.","source_cn":"让我来问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B8958510511469E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220423005:0":{"text":"루카 님!","source_cn":"卢卡先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3330EB1DF996D09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220